          "request": {
            "name": "🚧 Retrieve all loan doc tasks across a loan officer's loans (BETA)",
            "description": {
              "content": "> 🚧 Under construction\n> **This endpoint is in beta.** Functionality may change without notice, support is limited, and use in production is not recommended. Your feedback is appreciated.\n\nRetrieves all loan doc <<glossary:task>>s across loans the <<glossary:loan officer>> owns.",
